@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title ADR-031 — versioned catalog domain extension
class CatalogSource {
 Organization
 ID
 Repository / Branch / TagPattern / ManifestPath
 Version
 ObservedTags / LastChecked / SafeCode
 AccountSlots
}
class CatalogRelease <<immutable>> {
 Organization / SourceID / Tag
 Commit / ObservedBranchTip
 Manifest / ManifestSHA256
 VerifiedComponents
}
class VerifiedComponent <<value>> {
 ID / Kind / Path / SHA256
 BundleID or DefinitionSnapshot
 BindingSlot
}
class CatalogSelection <<value>> {
 SourceID / Tag / Fingerprint
 AccountBindingSnapshot
}
class EnvironmentCatalog {
 EnvironmentIdentity
 Revision
 Desired / Applied
 Status
}
class Environment
class ActiveResource {
 LogicalIdentity
 DefinitionKey
 CatalogSource / CatalogTag
 LastAcknowledgedDeployment
}
class DeploymentPlan <<immutable>> {
 CatalogSelection / CatalogPin
 Matches / Terraform / Rendering
}
class ResourceDefinition
CatalogSource "1" -- "0..*" CatalogRelease
CatalogRelease "1" *-- "1..*" VerifiedComponent
Environment "1" *-- "0..1" EnvironmentCatalog
EnvironmentCatalog "1" *-- "1..2" CatalogSelection
CatalogSelection --> CatalogRelease
VerifiedComponent --> ResourceDefinition : immutable configuration copy
ActiveResource --> CatalogRelease : optional acknowledged snapshot
DeploymentPlan --> CatalogSelection : pinned provenance
note bottom of ActiveResource
 Exactly one legacy Definition FK or catalog snapshot reference.
 Resource/state identity excludes catalog version.
 Historical execution outcomes keep original cleanup artifacts.
end note
@enduml
